<http://example.org/aquadiva/core> a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:label "AquaDiva Core Ontology"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Core ontology for describing aquifer ecosystems, hydrochemistry, microbial communities, and groundwater processes."@en .

